Note = {2nd Global Conference on Psychology Researches (GCPR), Univ Barcelona,
   Barcelona, SPAIN, NOV 28-29, 2014},
Abstract = {This study aimed to identify the emotional labor levels of nurse
   academicians and was conducted with 152 nurse academicians working at
   nursing departments of public and private universities in Istanbul.
   According to the results, the mean score of the scale was 3.01 +/- 0.51
   in total, 1.68 +/- 0.69 in superficial acting dimension, 2.86 +/- 1.24
   in deep acting dimension, and 4.49 +/- 0.55 in expression of
   naturally-felt emotions dimension. Nurse academicians working at public
   universities for at least 6 years evaluated the emotional labor score in
   total and in deep acting dimension higher than the others (p < 0.05). In
   conclusion, they performed mid-level emotional labor in general. (C)
