Note = {AHFE Virtual Conference on Human Factors and Ergonomics in Healthcare
   and Medical Devices, ELECTR NETWORK, JUL 25-29, 2021},
Abstract = {Chronic disease is one of the important reasons affecting the health of
   the elderly. As the treatment of chronic diseases generally has a long
   cycle and slow results, the management of chronic diseases in the
   elderly is very important. Considering meeting their physical and
   psychological needs, this research proposes a chronic disease treatment
   and management plan in an interactive manner. This program helps users
   to get a more convenient ``purchase medicine - take medicine manage
   medicine{''} experience. The program includes a smart medicine box and
   an auxiliary APP. It is designed to help users recover from chronic
   diseases more conveniently. Also, this research takes into account the
   needs of users for family affection and included children in the
   recuperation process. This research is oriented to the needs of the
   elderly with chronic diseases and provides insightful explorations for
   their treatment options.},
