   resource constrained environments. mHealth4Afrika has co-designed a
   comprehensive range of functionality and medical programs in partnership
   with Ministries of Health, district health officers, clinic managers and
   primary healthcare workers from urban, rural and deep rural health
   facilities in Ethiopia, Kenya, Malawi and South Africa. This paper
   provides insights into how mHealth4Afrika is leveraging HL7 FHIR to
