   motivate learning and information seeking where they have little
   knowledge about politics and political process. By selecting some
   controversial issues, political parties will try to produce their
   political messages that can easily influencing voters' emotion,
   cognitive, information seeking and political choice. Therefore, this
   paper will discuss on which political choice behaviour models can be
   significantly influence voters' anxiety and their political choice. In
   Malaysia experience, does anxiety play a significant role in influencing
   voters `choice or behaviour in an election mainly the young voters or
   they are only influence by massive political campaign and canvassing
   where political parties spend millions of ringgits to influence the
