Note = {Annual Conference of the China-Association-for-Science-and-Technology,
   Wuhan, PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP 08-14, 2007},
Organization = {China Assoc Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {Requisition-compensation balance of farmland resources is always an
   important problem of the national land resources management in China.
   Having analyzed numbers of requisition-compensation of farmland land
   from construction of Xinjiang and the backup farmland land resource of
   Xinjiang until 2030. It can be concluded that long-term
   requisition-compensation of farmland resources in Xinjiang can be surely
   realized. Based on special nature, economy, humanities condition of
   Xinjiang, it can be said that the grassland resources should be
   protected like farmland protection. It should be adopted certain
   economical measurements to encourage people who compensate better and
   more farmland after occupying farmland to construct and to punish the
   contrary. Then, the amount, quality and ecological balance can be
   realized surely in the process of Requisition-compensation balance of
   farmland resources. Aim at the balance of ecosystem, it is necessary to
   further classify ecology-use land category in the land classification
   system. It is necessary to research grasslands resources graduation. It
   is important to divide grade of grasslands resources based on its
   ecological effects. And it is feasible to develop and reclamation the
   backup farmland resources scientifically and reasonably in Xinjiang. All
   these works can provide necessary theories and technique foundation for
   the long-term requisition-compensation balance of farmland management of
   Xinjiang.},
