   (e.g. ISPA {[}The Instrument for Structural Policies for Pre-accession]
   - Environment) that would lead to a better administration of waste
   materials associated with these activities (e.g. recycling ill the
   economic Circuit or the easy reintegration into the environment), as
   well as to monitoring the natural and the social environment that is to
   be found under the incidence of this type of pollution.
   At present, the district of Dambovita goes over the steps of the process
   regarding the development of an integrated management system of solid
   waste in the urban and rural areas of the territory (elaborating the
   regional waste management plans, elaborating the passive prognosis and
   the general objectives, including assessing the current situation).
   The problems of the environmental protection in the influence area of
   Doicesti TEPS (Thermoelectric Power Station), in the context of a
   lasting development, are focused on fighting against the inherent
   phenomena of industrial waste Pollution (slag and ashes). The measures
   related to reducing the impact that these waste types have oil the
   environment, and that constitute the subject of the present article, are
   centred upon modernizing the storage conditions corroborated with the
   physical and socio-economic characteristics of the habitat in view of
