   local pollutants and greenhouse gases due to growing local
   transportation in urban areas. SND system is a combination of e-commerce
   and centralized pickup point (PP), with the PP being it location that
   the consumer will already be visiting regularly. Transportation energy
   consumption and concomitant emissions in the three delivery systems
   (traditional networked delivery (TND) system, e-commerce networked
   delivery (END) system, and sustainable networked delivery (SND)) were
   compared. Our research results show that the SND system has a lot of
