   (URDC), Famagusta, CYPRUS, DEC 07-09, 2011},
Abstract = {The design of metal deck roof system should incorporate some sound
   insulation materials if it were to insulate structure borne impact noise
   such as from the rain, transmitted into a building. The noise from the
   rain may affect the ambient noise level within the space underneath the
   roof thus affect the occupants' comfort. Thus, this paper would like to
   examine the relationship between the annoyance responses with noise
   disturbance on occupants' activities and side effects face by
   occupants'. The result reveals the impact from rain noise amplified by
   metal correlated with annoyances which cause uncomfortable condition to
   the occupant. (C) 2011 Published by Elsevier Ltd. Selection and
