   18-22, 1992},
Abstract = {The purpose of this study is to analyse the diurnal variability of CO
   concentration observations using different fitted statistical
   distributions. A simple microscale dispersion model was also used to
   predict the local effect of heavily-travelled roads on carbon monoxide
   concentrations measured at certain monitoring stations in the
