Abstract = {Adolescence is a critical period for adolescents all over the world
   because this is the time they have to develop an identity. Students who
   wish to be future teachers should not be unsure of their future plans. A
   survey was conducted among future English teachers by using a set of
   questionnaire adapted from the EOMEIS-2 by Bennion \& Adams (1986). The
   findings of this study are important to the lecturers teaching future
   English teachers so that they are aware of their students' sense of
   identity as well as help them reach identity achievement for a better
   quality of life. (C) 2012 Published by Elsevier B.V. Selection and/or
