Abstract = {Environmental pollution may directly decrease output and decreasing
   productivity of man-made capital and labor. The distressfulness and the
   long term damaging effect of this environmental pollution can contribute
   to destructive consequences on human wellbeing and economy. The purpose
   of the study is to examine the relationship between CO2 on economic
   growth in Asean 8. The income levels per capita gross domestic product
   per capita were measured from the year 1965 to 2010. This study
   formulates a three equation simultaneous model for empirical research.
   In the pollution indicator emissions, CO2 in Asean 8, the Environmental
   Kuznets Curve relationship is found. (C) 2011 Published by Elsevier Ltd.
