   Romeris Univ, Vilnius, LITHUANIA, AUG 18-22, 2009},
Abstract = {In this study researcher investigated psychological traits and
   attachment with the father in childhood of university students by using
   psychological tests. The subjects were 225 students belonged to
   university of metropolitan area. A test battery the following (1) EQ
   Test (2) Star Wave Test; SWT (3) Attachment scale with the father. Those
   were administered in June of 2008. The main findings were as the Group p
   H can bild the good social relationship and have stable emotion, on the
   other hand Group L showed weak attachment with their father in
   childhood, which may be effects not only to their low communication
   skills, also to their impatience, depressive mood and social adjustment
   problem. The father-child attachment is very important to establish
   social skills and stable emotion in the youth.},
